# **Knight Lore — Data & Sprite Asset Specification (Godot Reimplementation)**

This document defines the sprite asset naming table (referencing the SkoolKit disassembly naming convention), all decoded background/foreground templates, special object spawns, and the exact room-data decoder for location\_tbl.

